8.2   Model Generalization
   To assess our model’s generalization, we used men’s singles data from the 2017 French Open,
which shares similarities with the 2023 Wimbledon Championships, including the best-of-five set
format and IBM Slamtracker data collection. Despite differences in court surfaces (red clay vs.
grass), our model maintained prediction accuracy, indicating good generalization.




                                                                             型
    In particular, the match between Andy Murray and Andrey Kuznetsov highlighted the model’s
reliability. Murray’s dominance, reflected in his MMTTV, aligned with our predictions and the




                                                              模
match’s outcome, further confirming the model’s effectiveness.




