9    Sensitivity Analysis
    We conduct a sensitivity analysis on our model to assess its stability under external distur-
bances, thereby highlighting its advantages. As shown in Fig.x, when we alter the initial game
win probability as input, the overall trend prediction curve exhibited minimal translation despite
significant deviations in the initial values. The stability of the curve trend remain intact, ensuring




                                                                              型
no impact on our MMT swing predictions. This demonstrates the strong robustness of our model.




